note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 5 layout line 158: fields at declared width and endianness; a big-endian field is
note stored most significant byte first, a little-endian one least significant first, and get reads
note the value back. Erratum E5: fa and fb have COUNT 1, so they are arrays and take index 0. stdout: the 16 bytes, then the four values in hex (exp/l5-endian.out, python3).
om2
layout be16 16
field fa uint 1 at 0 big
field fb ulong 1 at 4 big
field fc ushort 2 at 12 little
end
fn fill x edit be16 to void
put x fa 0 0x0a0b0c0d
put x fb 0 0x0102030405060708
put x fc 0 0xbeef
put x fc 1 0x1234
end
fn show x view be16 to void
puth ulong get x fa 0
puth get x fb 0
puth ulong get x fc 0
puth ulong get x fc 1
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 16 0
fill c
w = write 1 c 0 16
show c
ret 0
end
